# Scope is deliberately narrow - NOT a `*` catch-all, which would require
# code-owner review on every PR. Raising VERSION cuts a minor/major release,
# so it is gated here; the workflows and CODEOWNERS are gated so the
# release/versioning machinery can't change unreviewed.
/VERSION              @degory
/.github/workflows/   @degory
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @degory
